  "description": "Emily is the daughter of a count who forms a temporary marriage contract with the duke's son, Kyle, so she can divorce him later and secure her family title. However, she is plagued by steamy dreams about him every night, which makes her fall for her husband in reality. And right when their contract expires, Kyle returns from an expedition with amnesia! Realizing he remembers nothing of their original agreement, Emily is thrilled and decides to keep him for good. But how long will this convenient memory loss last...?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64002037), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B2%B0%ED%98%BC-%EA%B3%84%EC%95%BD%EC%9D%84-%EC%97%B0%EC%9E%A5%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/4041)  \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64002024)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/how-to-extend-your-marriage-contract-m), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/169718)  \nR15: [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/how-to-extend-your-marriage-contract), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/169719)",
